4. **Payment and Loan Extension Confusion** : After adhering to the payment schedule for 75 months, I expected my loan to be fully paid off in XX/XX/XXXX. Recently, I found out that my loan would not be paid off until XX/XX/XXXX, and that failing to pay the total amount in full by that time would result in a daily interest charge of {$0.00}. This delay and the way it was communicated have caused considerable confusion and anxiety. 

